<title>SRI LANKA: Commercial Bank up on interim profits.</title>
<headline>Commercial Bank up on interim profits.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Commercial Bank of Ceylon ltd rose 4.1 percent, or five rupees to 125 rupees a voting share, on turnover of 2,800 shares, brokers said.</p>
<p>&quot;Investors are attracted by an almost 10 percent rise in the net profits to September 30,&quot; said a local broker.</p>
<p>Commercial Bank is one of four private commercial banks listed in Colombo.</p>
<p>--Colombo newsroom (41) 434319</p>
</text>
